To often clean the toughened glass , in daily cleaning, wipe with a wet towel or newspaper, wet towel can wipe most stains, newspaper can wipe the water on the surface of the glass.Because the strain point of toughened glass is all concentrated in the corner, the protection of the corner is more important, it is necessary to check the corner often to see if there is any damage.
News - Toughened glass, its advantages and disadvantages, do you know?
Toughened glass, its advantages and disadvantages, do you know? News
2, thermal stability improvement: toughened glass can withstand huge temperature difference without damage, resistance to temperature difference is the same thickness of ordinary float glass 3 times.It can withstand the temperature difference of 150℃ and has obvious effect on preventing thermal cracking.
2, toughened glass strength is stronger than ordinary glass, but the toughened glass in the temperature difference is large when the possibility of self-explosion (their rupture), and ordinary glass does not exist the possibility of self-explosion.
In addition, the middle part of the tempered glass is the strongest, and the corners and edges are the weakest.In case of emergency, the tempered glass can be broken to escape.The best way is to use a safety hammer or other sharp hard piece of glass to hit the edges and corners of the glass, especially in the middle of the top edge of the glass, once the glass has a crack, it is easy to break the whole glass.
How to judge whether it is laminated safety glass?
To choose according to the use of the scene, such as the railing glass does not bear horizontal load should be safety glass, if the use of laminated glass, its nominal thickness is not less than 6.38mm.The guardrail glass bearing horizontal load shall be tempered laminated glass of nominal thickness not less than 12 mm.
When laminated safety glass is used outdoors, do not expose the edge of laminated glass, because the edge will be degummed due to moisture absorption, and there are safety risks.Construction, should use neutral silicone glue or polysulfide glue, should not use acid silicone glue or putty sealant, because the former sealing degree is better.
When the temperature reaches 6000 degrees, the section steel will melt;
In addition, in the high temperature environment, the glass itself has the characteristic of cracking, which increases the difficulty of safe evacuation and fire fighting.
Considering the wall structure stability and sealing ability, shoulder open window glass curtain wall is often not even opened the window of shoulder, in order to ensure the safety of the window frame, basic Windows are small and at the same time the window openings for suspension, and metope Angle of up to 45 degrees, so that not only reduce the vent area, and the window rolled over the wall, and metope below not ventilation window,
