Generally, the curtain wall of hidden frame is much less cracked. The main reasons are as follows: the elastic material with poor thermal conductivity around the glass is in soft contact with the aluminum frame, and there is no heat exchange between the glass and the aluminum frame, which reduces the temperature difference between various parts of the glass caused by the heat dissipation of the glass;
The temperature in the middle of the glass reaches 60-70 ℃ , while the edge is only 25-30 ℃ , with a difference of dozens of degrees, which is obviously felt by the hand, so it produces great thermal stress in the inside of the glass, which is easy to cause th e glass to crack.
After the rubber strip is clamped between the gap between the two sides of the glass and the aluminum frame, the glass glue can be made to ensure their absolute separation, elastic contact and thermal insulation.
Edge is the most fragile glass, there are many micro cracks and defects (such as collapse, avalanche Angle, pliers while not neat, etc.) can reduce the edge allowable stress more than a dozen times, large thermal stress and external shocks easily cause from here start to crack, so the best coated glass cutting machine cutting, manual cutting must be strict inspection when the glass on the edge of the cutting quality,
In addition, the more irregular the shape of the glass is, the unbalanced stress in various parts and directions will also increase the probability of thermal stress fracture. Reasonable design is the most important factor to reduce the impact in this respect.
Influence of shadows: outdoor objects or the building structure itself may leave shadows on the glass, resulting in different temperature differences due to different heat absorption in different parts of the glass. The more irregular the shadow shape is, the more likely the glass is to break.
Therefore, the indoor shading device increases the glass temperature inhomogeneity, but also increases the probability of thermal stress self-explosion, should be avoided as far as possible.
The influence of glass reprocessing: the reprocessing of coated glass increases the factors of glass cracking.
