In recent years, “low-end free-for-all, high-end lost” has become an embarrassing situation for most enterprises in China’s manufacturing field.
This means may bring some benefits in the short term, but in the long run, it is absolutely the worst strategy. However, many enterprises focus on the immediate petty profits and ignore the long-term consideration, not only “self-harm”, but also hurt their peers.
When the products of two brands are similar, people usually tend to choose the one with the lower price. A slight difference in quality may also result in a huge difference in the effects in the use process.
Because luxury has the support of brand, more importantly, quality as the core, so that people believe that such quality should match such a high price.
In most cases, the reason is that enterprises, regardless of the quality of their products, always quote inflated prices. Once the market is bad, they will give themselves the opportunity to cut prices and promote sales, thus giving consumers the impression that the price of products can be reduced.
Of course, large enterprises, product quality advantage of the enterprise never easy price, often also disdain to participate in the price war.
They do not believe in the so-called “good and cheap”, they admit that “German goods are good and cheap”, but people are willing to buy “made in Germany” even if it is expensive.
More than 30% of Germany’s export goods are exclusive products without competitors in the international market. From the big excavator to the small stapler, people feel that “the value of expensive is expensive” in terms of quality.
In the glass industry, with the continuous development of real estate, the demand for glass will only increase, and the requirements for safety, energy saving and environmental protection will only increase. The consumption concept of the new generation of consumers is already different from the past, and they will pay more attention to the “value” of products rather than the “price”.
