Insulation type fireproof glass partition wall: in a certain time can simultaneously meet the requirements of fire integrity and fire insulation (loss of fire insulation, that is, the average temperature rise of the back fire surface is more than 140 degrees or the highest temperature rise to 180 degrees).
Steel frame fireproof glass partition wall: made of square steel or shaped steel plate, through welding or special screw connection fixed, and with insulation material, steel frame filled with non-combustible material, to ensure fire to meet the fire requirements.
