Made exclusively for us in the US from a unique steel/magnesium alloy, these round spring-tempered split rings are 25% stronger than stainless steel — and unlike stainless or titanium, they always spring fully-closed. They’re burnished and tumbled for smoothness, then nickel-plated for corrosion resistance.
If you’re looking for the best round split rings for attaching a camera strap — you found them. more…
Details Normally, you don’t hear lengthy descriptions about the seemingly mundane rings that attach your camera strap, but there’s a little bit of a story behind these, so here goes: When we started development on ourF1 Series camera straps, we were shocked at how difficult it was to find strong, round, smooth split rings.
Most of the imported rings we tested had nice smooth ends, but failed our strength tests miserably (yes — we test everything). Some of the “strong” imported split rings failed at under 20lbs (9.1kg) …Not good!
