Amino acid cleanser containing proper skin care ingredients, such as moisturizing factor, such as nutrients, it is because of these skin care ingredients, after the skin with the amino acid cleanser, a bit tight, also won’t feel any drying ten water embellish feels more Q, amino acid cleanser on clean skin at the same time, can lock the moisture, and moisturize the skin.
We know that skin oil, air dust, all kinds of dirt will lead to skin pore blockage, and amino acids not only have the ability to clean these dirt, but also can remove the dirt that has entered the pore, to achieve a real sense of deep cleaning, avoid a series of skin problems such as pore blockage, pore bulkiness.
But the cleaning effect of amino acid facial cleanser on oil is not so strong, and it also adds moisturizing agent, so while cleaning the skin, it can also maintain the water and oil balance of the skin, and reduce the secretion of oil. moisturizing
If adhere to use amino acid to wash a face milk for a long time, still can have the effect of beautiful white.
Selected amino acid cleanser is weak acidic amino acids surfactants used as raw materials, in addition also contains amino acid moisturizing factor, amino acid nutritional agent, amino acids and exquisite foam agent, amino acid cleanser PH value between 5.5 to 5.6, with the body’s PH value is very close, so the amino acid cleanser stimulus to human skin is very small. Whether skin is acidic or alkaline varies from person to person.
When we classify the skin as acidic or alkaline, it mainly depends on the pH value. When the human skin PH value is between 7.35 and 7.45, it is alkaline skin, while when the human skin PH value is below 7.35, it is acidic skin.
Everyone’s skin condition is different, some people’s skin is acidic, some people’s skin is alkaline, if it is acidic skin, choose alkaline facial cleanser will be better, because this acid and alkali neutralization, is more conducive to the health of the skin;
Because this acid cleanser and alkaline cleanser each have their own benefits, no one is better said, they are suitable for different skin.
Advantages: acidic facial cleanser is closer to the skin’s pH value, so it is relatively more mild, and will not feel irritated, dry and tight after use. Acid facial cleanser also has a protective effect on the sebaceous glands of the skin, so it is very suitable for dry and sensitive skin use.
The nature of acid wash a face milk is mild, the clean force of corresponding also is slightly weaker, because this is the oily skin that secretes exuberant to grease, the possibility can feel clean force is not enough.
Advantages: the cleaning power of alkaline facial cleanser is very strong, which can effectively remove the grease on the skin and the dirt in the pores, and make the skin return to the cleanest and refreshing posture.
The advantages of alkaline facial cleanser is also its shortcomings, it is because the cleaning power is too strong, to protect the skin’s sebaceous glands even have a certain harm, long-term use of alkaline facial cleanser, will destroy the skin’s protective layer, make the skin immunity decline, become more sensitive and fragile.
Wash a face with amino acid cleanser is the biggest benefit of mild stimulation, amino acid cleanser using weak acidic amino acids surfactants as raw materials, to make it from birth, it is more moderate than other cleanser, at the same time, also added a series of moisturizer in amino acid cleanser, nutritional agent, etc., for even the skin moist curing effect.
