Glass bottles in production after molding, sometimes there will be a lot of spots wrinkle skin, bubble scratches, etc., mostly caused by the following reasons:
When the glass blank falls into the initial mold, it cannot enter the initial mold accurately. The friction between the glass blank and the mold wall is too large, resulting in folds.
The glass bottle initial mold and molding material is poor, the density is not enough, the oxidation is too fast after high temperature, forming small concave point on the surface of the mold, resulting in the glass bottle surface after molding is not smooth and clean.
