Nathria Castle Wing 4 Now Available in Raid Finder!
But when drought and fear swept through the Shadowlands, Denathrius showed his true loyalties. Defying his former master, the noble Prince Renathal gathers his few remaining allies for a desperate mission: infiltrate Nathria Castle and remove Sire Denathrius from power.
Minimum Item Level for Raid Finder: 170
6 January: Raid Finder Wing 2 (Salvation of the Sun King, Xy'Mox Artificer, Blood Council)
February 3: Raid Finder Wing 4 (Sire Denathrius)
Alachilla is blind and tasked with guarding the entrance to Nathria Castle, so she uses horrifying screeches that reverberate off the chamber walls to detect her victims. The last thing intruders at the Grand Entrance hear is the scream it emits as it pounces on its prey.
Sire Denathrius seldom takes part in the hunts, but Altimor makes sure his lord has the best animals when he feels like it. Malblood, Bargast, and Hecutis have been training since before most beasts were born, and each of them is ready to unleash the hunter's wrath on anyone in their domain.
Some simply saw an opportunity and seized it. Artificer Xy'Mox has collaborated with Denathrius, but is more interested in taking most of the cake, which could force him to take down the invaders of Nathria.
Devourers consume anima wherever they find it. With the drought that has struck the Shadowlands, it is little wonder that the hungriest and most dangerous are drawn to the abundant reserves of anima that hold the depths of Nathria Castle.
The anima is the lifeblood of the Shadowlands, and Lady Innerva Dark Vena seeks to unravel its mysteries. Under Denathrius' tutelage, he has uncovered insidious secrets that he can employ against his enemies.
Lord Stavros, a smug dandy, directs court dances, but is also lethal with his swords. Baroness Frieda, mistress of anima magic, runs the dredger service and is respected by the entire court.
Fistfist was born in the muddy foundations of Nathria Castle and now prowls the rooms while awaiting orders from Sire Denathrius. Their colossal footsteps reverberate throughout the castle, announcing their arrival several rooms away.
Ancient Stoneborn Generals Grashaal and Kaal have closely followed each step of Prince Renathal's rebellion. Once a mentor and apprentice respectively to General Draven, now his strength, strategy and soldiers have rebelled against him and anyone who opposes the will of the sire.
But, in the dark hours of the Shadowlands, he has turned his back on his sacred work. With the help of Remornia, his bloodthirsty living blade, and defended by his most abject faithful, he will destroy those who stand in his way and throw their remains to the terror of the Maw.
Dirtwing's Revenge: Defeat Grudge Punch after he collides with the Pillars in the order that Mud Alas prefers at Nathria Castle on Normal difficulty or higher.
: Defeat the Generals of the Stone Legion while all players are carrying a bouquet of Blooming Blood Roses to Nathria Castle on Normal difficulty or higher.
