Examples of initial anima powers. Which one would you choose?
Two new playable races: Fight for the Horde with the blood elves to find a new source of arcane power or join the ranks of the Alliance with the draenei to help them find a new home after their exile from Outland.
Jewelry: Carve gems of power to insert into the players' equipment with the jewelry profession.
This requires converting more than 750 rows of data from the 000 format to the one we use today. Luckily we have talented and committed engineers employing scripts that facilitate these conversions, although that does not mean that we can use only these automatic transformations.
As 13 years have passed since the launch of The Burning CrusadeWe also have to stop to confirm that our memories coincide with how things really were. It is easy for time to change our perceptions: we could come across something and think that it is a mistake, but perhaps it is actually how it worked in The Burning Crusade.
Sometimes the transfer of this data has unforeseen consequences. In the initial tests we found things like that the male blood elf was naked even though the client believed that he was dressed.
We also found that water appeared in Hellfire Peninsula, where it is not supposed to exist. Outland does not have oceans like Azeroth, but this was something we were able to correct.
In order to Burning Crusade Classic we also want to make sure we offer an experience close to The Burning Crusade, while maintaining the essential elements of the expansion that players expect. We have also implemented other changes to offer you good experiences when you arrive in Outland.
We want to make sure we preserve the identity of the factions, but we also know that there is an imbalance between the paladin seals of the Horde and the Alliance, as Seal of Blood (Horde) is very powerful compared to Seal of Vengeance (Alliance). To address this issue, the Horde and Alliance will continue to earn their faction seals at level 64, but upon reaching 70, they will also receive the other faction's seal.
With the release of the preliminary patch for Burning Crusade Classic, players will have early access to the Blood Elf and Draenei races prior to the opening of the Dark Portal. This will allow them to level up early to join their friends in Outland later.
To make it easier for players to stay up-to-date on recent content and to browse gear with their friends, we've put together a potential content release plan for Burning Crusade Classic divided into 5 phases. As is usually the case with early development, these plans may change at any time, and we'd like to hear your thoughts on this.
4 phase: Zul'Aman and Arena Season 3
How to meet the diverse needs of players
Hereinafter, the current commercial servers of WoW Classic will become progressive servers with access to Burning Crusade Classic and its content updates. When the patch is rolled out, players will need to decide what they want to do with their characters - will they move on to the content of Burning Crusade Classic or they will continue with the experience of WoW Classic?
We want to make sure that your decision has weight and we are aware that some players may want to play a certain character both in WoW Classic as in Burning Crusade Classic, so we will enable an optional paid service that will allow you to unlock a clone of your character in both clients and thus continue your adventures in both eras. You can read more information about it in our article Characters and kingdoms of World of Warcraft Classic y Burning Crusade Classic.
The community has played an essential role in converting WoW Classic a success, so we can't wait for you to try the beta of Burning Crusade Classic and contribute once again to create the best possible product. We love working in WoW Classic And we want to thank you for helping us bring Azeroth to life.
