Return to the Maw as the Kyrians, Night Sylphs, Necromancers, and Venthyr have regained their strength to embark on a campaign that will unite the four and allow them to launch a joint attack against the Jailer. By unveiling the Jailer's dark designs, you can call on a new inner strength to fight and even use your mounts again in this dark realm.
Available only on Mythic difficulty, players will be able to obtain loot coveted by the Speculator society, including a dizzying number of weapons, supernatural pets, and a mount in this instance.
By taking the battle to the Jailer's territory, we can delve even further into his lair: Torghast, Tower of the Damned. Register a never-before-seen wing of Torghast as you battle new foes and avoid deadly traps with a host of game-changing powers.
We also want to remember that to enjoy the Battle for Azeroth pre-patch event it is not necessary to have the expansion reserved until August 14.
The only, and quite important, piece of information that is unknown is the release date. So first we will give you a quick summary of what each of the events will deal with and then get down to speculation by finding out the possible release date of pre-patch 8.0.
In the following link we have many more details and images of the pre-patch event of the Alliance: The attack on Lordaeron
As the Horde, your duty will be to protect and secure Lordaeron from the massive Alliance attack, preventing them from capturing Sylvanas.
With this video he explains the well-known farming between kingdoms, how it is done and which is the best Maldraxxus route for plants.
You will have to choose the game you want to enter with each of your available characters. The first time a player logs in with a character on a client, they will be asked to confirm if they want to activate it in that game.
On the day of the patch, you can open the Battle.net desktop app and choose the game you want: Burning Crusade Classic o WoW Classic.
After choosing a game, you will select a character to play and confirm your choice.
We'll provide more details on each realm type and the options available to characters later, closer to the release of Burning Crusade Classic. You can continue to find out here, on the official page of World of Warcraft.
This week of October 3-10 we will have a new bonus event. It is the Bonus Event: Sand Skirmishes in which we must win 10 sand skirmishes battles and we will also obtain an extra 50% honor for each battle won.
If you want to win this brawl, you are going to have to polish your skills, because the dunk ball has arrived in Pandaria. You will have to run to seize the balls that are in the center of the map or in the mines to the north and south, take them to the enemy base and make a magnificent long-distance shot or gamble and go for the mate.
Throughout this week we will have the following affixes for mythical +: Reinforced, Potentiating e Restless.
Potentiating: When an enemy that is not a boss dies, its death scream empowers nearby allies, increasing their maximum health and damage by 20%.
From the mythical dungeons +10 we will also have the Infested affix.
And as always, apart from the fun and missions that this fair offers us, we can also get toys, pets, mounts and countless achievements.
Beer Fest Celebrated by both the Horde and the Alliance, the Brewfest is the time to enjoy the fermented fruits of the harvest: crackers, cheese and drinks!
Band Tryouts - October 8
4 Chief of Upper Invasion Point
Throughout this week we will have active the Pet Battle Bonus Event during which, we will get 200% experience in pet battles. In Dalaran, Archmage Timereja will give us a mission in which we will have to win five PvP pet duels and reward us with a Ultimate Battle Training Stone, with which we can raise any of our low level pets, automatically to level 25.
This week from March 7 to 14, we will have active the camorra Hotmogu Temple . Venture into the Kotmogu Temple for this fast-paced encounter.
Exploitive: While in combat, enemies periodically summon explosive orbs that detonate if no one destroys them.
We will also have the profession missions that will give us 5 skill points in each of them. It is a good time to finish climbing that profession that we still do not have at the top.
Until March 9 we will continue to have the micro event active Style test. We are going to get handsome and parade in front of other players to see if we can win the first prize.
Also, and as I always tell you, we can take the opportunity to raise the level of our profession a few points if we still do not have it up to the top.
Today we bring you the Calendar for 2018 established where we will show you all the events and between which periods we can enjoy them. Without further ado, to nougat!
Day 3 -> Day 10 Battleground Bonus Event
