Awakening of the Hippogriff:Today is the day when the eggs of the Oldfeather Hippogriffs hatch. Head to the Oldfeather Highlands in Feralas to see the spectacle!
Speak to a transmogrifier in any major city to participate in the Trial of Style!
March of the Tadpoles:The day has come when the Winterfin murloc hatchlings of the Boreal Tundra complete their journey through the West Rift.
Fluo Mushroom Festival:The annual Sporaggar sporine mushroom festival in the Zangar Marshes is here!
Come with your people to represent the pride of your faction!
So now you know, there is no excuse to miss these events!
Last year we collaborated with our communities of World of Warcraft from around the world to create a new mount that we want to give to all players who have Shadowlands activated in your account. After receiving hundreds of thousands of votes, the wandering ancestor was the winner!
Not all ancestors are interested in war or knowledge, some just want to travel the world!
The Wandering Ancestor is one of the many things we will be introducing at BlizzConline. Get connected to BlizzConline to watch videos on demand for free and find out what's to come in World of Warcraft: Shadowlands y WoW Classic!
Commemorate 30 years of Blizzard with the Celebration Collection
This powerful pterrordax has a nest high in the mountains of Zuldazar, where the air is too thin for the lungs to breathe, and life cannot develop. Sometimes it goes down to the swamps in search of more succulent prey with which to feed its brood.
These are the skills that we must keep in mind when we face this new boss of the world.
Hurricane impact: Ji'arak rises and draws enemies towards her. After 8 seconds, Ji'arak falls hard, dealing 78.535 points of Physical damage to all enemies trapped below.
Then I leave you what we must take into account depending on which character we face this world boss.
Leggings of Wild Winged Terror: Level 355 Leather Legs.
Shadow Veil of the Matriarch: Cloth head level 355.
Sorry if this has been posted already, just trying to get the word out. With this patch you can transmog your gear to 1-60 items for your class (tier items included).
Examining the other level ranges it appears to follow the same pattern as level scaling. To unlock the skins, you'll need to collect them with a higher-level character, but since the transmog collections are account-wide, you simply have to log in with the lower-level character and transmogrify them to use the skin.
At level 58 you can transmogrify team appearances up to level 80, including Black Temple tiers and Icecrown Citadel.
At level 90, you can transmogrify team appearances up to level 100, including challenge gear from Warlords of Draenor.
Developer Notes: This may cause some events to change slightly on the schedule for Australian players. Check the game schedule for up-to-date local times
Killing Purpose increases damage taken by 3% per stack (up from 5%). Druid
Oppressor increases damage taken by 3% per stack (up from 5%).
Booming Voice now grants 30 Rage in PvP situations (from 60 Rage).
Lord Godfrey should no longer disappear at the beginning of "The Great Escape."
"Rocket Rescue" should now have a marker for the location of the Steam Boom Balloon.
Hounds of Sargeras Resolved an issue which could sometimes cause Shadowscar to move a player out of the bounds of the playspace.
Fixed an issue that could cause in-game holidays to start or finish up to an hour early or late on the Australian realms. This also resolves an issue where the Stranglethorn Vale fishing tournament was inaccessible in Australia.
Forbearant Faithful increases cooldown recovery rate by 20% in PvP situations (was 50%).
Booming Voice now grants 30 Rage in PvP situations (was 60 Rage).
Quests Sapper Specialists should now drop the Keg of Blast-O Powder for the Alliance quest «Powder Play».
Scenarios to unlock later portions of the Isle of Thunder can now be started at level 85 (was 90).
Developer Note: Phalanxes still appear weaker than Halberdiers, so some extra durability will allow them to tank before players complete their squad.
Rencissa the Dynamo's spell effectiveness increased by 40%.
Hojanoche's health increased by 20% and his spell effectiveness by 25%.
Developer Note: A few companions of the night sylphs curia have not adapted to their respective roles as well as we would like. To fix this, we've improved many abilities and reduced the overall fragility of some of these companions.
Many abilities now perform better at avoiding enemies the player is not facing during combat (eg, Summon Spirits, Meteor Shower, Chain Harvest, Fel Bombardment, or Divine Havoc).
Abominable Limb (Necromancers) now deals damage and pulls enemies while the Death Knight is under a crowd control effect.
The Damage Reduction debuff and Strength buff from Quota of Death (Night Sylphs) have been increased to 2% (was 1%). The spell now stacks up to 4 times (was 8).
Flamegrass (Necromancers) has been redesigned: Your damaging abilities have a chance to summon a demon from the Theater of Pain for 25 sec. Throwing Glaive deals lethal damage to the demon, which explodes when killed.
Demon Detention will no longer draw creatures into combat when Imprison ends.
Wild Growth healing increased by 7%.
The damage dealt and healing done by Adaptive Swarm (Necromancers) has been increased by 25%. Additionally, the effectiveness of its periodic effects has been increased to 25% (was 20%) and 35% for Balance druids.
Arcane: Now grants a stack of free cast (instead of mana) when a mirror is consumed.
Touch of Death is now affected by Mastery: Combo Strikes.
Fixed an issue that allowed the spirits of Storm, Earth, and Fire to continue channeling Fists of Fury after the channeling of Monk's Fists of Fury has ended.
The Spirit Shell talent now absorbs 80% of the healing done (was 100%). Additionally, the absorption limit depends on the caster's spell power and not on his maximum health.
Divine Hymn increases healing received by 4% (was 10%) for 15 seconds (was 8 seconds). Stacks up to 5 times (instead of not stacking).
Dice Mince (Rank 2) has been removed.
Fixed a bug that allowed the Poison Bomb talent to deal damage to targets affected by Bash without interrupting the crowd control effect.
Fixed an issue where Echoing Rebuke (Kyrians) would apply Discover Weakness to rogues other than Subtlety if cast while stealth.
Jagged Bone Spike (Necromancers) is now removed when the target leaves combat. Additionally, it does not return a charge and is removed when the target is fully healed.
Fixed a bug that caused the Tempt Luck buff to be removed when any Luck Buff ends.
Earthquake damage increased by 70%.
Stormscaller can now be triggered by the Ice Strike and Split talents, as intended.
Fixed an issue where the Earth Wall Totem talent could absorb more damage than intended when an area of effect spell affected multiple allies.
Damage dealt and healing done by Chain Harvest (venthyr) for Restoration and Elemental Shamans have been increased by 15%.
Seed of Corruption now deals the damage it owes and applies Corruption if the seed explodes while the Warlock is under a crowd control effect.
The following summoned creatures now obey the primary pet commands: Terror Slayers, Demon Tyrants, Fel Evils, Nether Portal Demons, and Grimoire Fel Guards: Fel Guard.
The damage bonus for missing health on the Exterminating Bolt (Necromancer) target has been increased to 100% (was 60%).
Fixed a bug that prevented the Whirlwind buff from being applied to the Warrior if Whirlwind was cast during Charge.
Damage of all abilities increased by 10%. Thunderclap damage increased by an additional 10%.
Conqueror's Banner (Necromancers) has been redesigned: You wield the Conqueror's Banner, granting you and your 2 closest allies 400. Mastery and 30% bonus movement speed, as well as preventing movement speed from falling below 100%.
Shaping Flesh has been redesigned: You form a shield of flesh and blood for 3 seconds (was 4 seconds) that absorbs damage equal to 40% of your maximum health for 2 minutes. While channeling, the damage you take is reduced by 20%.
Skeleton Control now summons a skeleton when the passive effect of Shape Meat consumes a corpse. This effect has a 5 second cooldown between each Skeleton Summon.
The spirits that inhabit the Queen's Greenhouse are eager to come back to life and will now provide their reward to players without needing to speak to them first.
Guests with whom you achieve Best Friend status will now provide you with a permanent RSVP.
Upon reaching the Exalted reputation level with the Ember Court, it is now possible to purchase a book from Temel in Sin Leap that links to the account This book is used to teach your Dredger Steward how to carry out the cleaning and resupplying missions that follow the Ember Courts.
Anima Cage now lasts 1 minute after activation (was 45 seconds). While active, Sin Leap's Blessing will be applied to players when an enemy dies nearby (instead of only affecting certain enemies), and its duration has been increased to 75 seconds (was 60 seconds).
Previously, players were always given a keystone one level below the highest they had completed so far in Season 1.
For example, a player who has completed a level 15 keystone will receive a level 14 keystone the following week. If you don't complete a keystone of level 15 or higher during that week, you will receive a keystone of level 13 the week after.
The Wandering Ancestor, the mount voted by the community, is now available!
Item Level 213: Requires the achievement "Conqueror of the Cornerstone", obtained by completing all eight dungeons of Shadowlands at mythic level 10 or more within the time limit.
Completing a Mythic Keystone dungeon after time expires now provides a second item as a reward. The level of this item will be slightly lower (eg completing a Mythic Keystone dungeon at Mythic level 7 now, but out of time gives the party a level 200 item and a level 197 item).
Power Conduits can now also be obtained at Nathria Castle.
When players recruit the maximum number of souls for their curia, the weekly quest to rescue souls from the Maw now awards 500. of soul.
Fel Bombardment buff duration increased to 40 seconds (was 30 seconds) and its trigger chance increased by 5%.
The Eye Beam spell cast by the summoned ally of Collective Anguish now always critically hits.
Potential activations per minute increased to 2 (was 1,66).
Magistrate's Judgment now grants the correct amount of Crusade stacks when spending Holy Power under its effects.
Searing Shadows healing increased by 36%, and can now heal critically.
Searing Shadows can now be combined with Mastery: Grace.
The cooldown on spells copied from Divine Image has been removed (eg, chaining Shadow Word: Death after Holy Fire now triggers Burning Light twice).
Restrained Contemplation is now removed when starting an arena encounter.
Winds of Doom's debuff now persists beyond death.
Jonathan's Natural Focus now increases the effect of the next Chain Heal by 20% (was 10%).
Wrath of Consumption duration increased to 30 seconds (was 20 seconds) and its periodic damage increased to 6% (was 5%).
Weapons Increased the chance for Enduring Blow to apply the Colossal Smash effect to 25% (was 15%) and its duration to 6 seconds (was 5 seconds).
Reckless Defense now triggers on all Rampage hits (was Rampage critical hits) and reduces the remaining cooldown on Recklessness and Enraged Regeneration by 1 second (was 3 seconds).
Retaliation has been redesigned: Charge and Intervene grant you Shield Block for 4 sec and Revenge !, in addition to generating 20. of anger.
Focused Assault and Brutal Assault now increase damage taken by 10% per stack and reduce healing taken by 5% per stack at Warsong Gulch, Twin Peaks, and Eye of the Storm.
The number of Artifact Shards required to summon Kronus and Fangraal has been reduced to 1500 (was 3000).
The spells of the tower mages of the Horde and Alliance have been adjusted:
Winds of Northrend now deals 15% of the target's maximum health in Frost damage.
Frostbolt Volley now deals 15% of the target's maximum health in Frost damage.
Living Bomb's initial spell now deals 5% of the target's maximum health as Fire damage.
Needle launcher health increased by 40%.
The damage required to break down the fortress walls has been increased by 20%.
Destroying towers reduces the duration of the game by 8 min (was 5 min)
All unranked players on the battlefield (including those who joined mid-game) will now be promoted to corporal after 5 min.
Fixed an issue where the effect of Illidan's Grab PvP talent on recast would not knock back the target.
Summoning Spirits (Night Sylphs) no longer casts Full Moon and Feral Frenzy for Restoration or Guardian Druids in combat against enemy players.
The Ultimate Sacrifice PvP talent now causes Blessing of Sacrifice to last 6 seconds in addition to its existing effects.
Fixed a bug that prevented the Royal Decree conduit from affecting the Forgotten Queen's Guardian PvP talent.
Fixed an issue where the resurrection bonus from the PvP talent Ultimate Retribution was not applied to the paladin when an ally died.
Greater Fade is now canceled when players attempt to capture a PvP target.
The PvP Talent Control and Conquer can no longer nullify an Adrenaline Rush with increased duration.
Hex now interrupts players who are channeling the capture of a PvP target if the player is susceptible to that spell.
Fixed a bug that caused the War Banner PvP talent to terminate prematurely if multiple War Banners were active.
Fixed a bug that caused the Advanced PvP talent to be incorrectly consumed by reflected damage triggers and area of effect spells.
A new account-bound unlockable has been added to Ve'nari that reveals the teleport nodes of all long walkable chains in Torghast. In this way, players with a fear of heights will be able to cross them quickly.
A specific item level is now recommended for the difficulty of each layer in order to increase the chances of raid success.
New Anima Power: Desolate Chitin (Unusual) - Shaping Flesh absorbs 50% more damage. Can be obtained 3 times.
New Anima Power: Icy Wild Seed (Epic) - Activating Soul Form stuns enemies within 12 yards of destination and exit locations for 6 sec. Can be obtained 1 time.
Monstrous Brew redesigned: Now increases damage and attack speed for you and all your minions by 10% for 8 seconds each time you cast Death Coil.
Insidious Putrefaction now has an extra charge and no longer grants 10% damage reduction within your Death and Decay.
Unbreakable Shackles now also increases Frost and Physical damage you deal to affected enemies by 15% and no longer increases the duration of Chains of Ice.
Lich Robe now reduces the cooldown of Born Lich by 4 seconds (was 10 seconds) for every 10. Runic Power expended (instead of when using Death Strike).
Seeker's Rage now increases the damage of your Demon Blades, Demon Bite, or Split by 2% per stack (was 20%) when destroying an Ashen Phylactery, and its effect is no longer consumed when casting Demon Blades, Demon Bite or Split.
Fixed an issue that caused Fogged Glass and Amplifying Mirror to sometimes remain active when Redirection ended.
New Anima Power: Gravity Dynamo (Epic) - Repel, root, or incapacitate enemies deals 50% additional damage with Fire, Arcane, and Frost spells for 8 seconds.
New Anima Power: Sorcerer's Frozen Soul (Uncommon) - Ice Block has no cooldown.
Maldo's Enchanted Staff, Maldo's Enchanted Staff, Tome of Zoomancy, and Alluring Cheese have been removed
New Anima Power: Dark Technique (Uncommon) - Enemies affected by Mind Bomb or Psychic Scream take damage equal to 5% of your health every 1 sec. This damage does not interrupt Mind Bomb or Psychic Scream.
New Anima Power: Archon Soul (Uncommon) - Power Infusion now also increases all periodic damage and healing by 100%.
New Anima Power: Light Infused Egg (Unusual) - Smite / Mind Torture have a 15% / 5% chance to grant you Power Infusion.
Estacarsis now correctly triggers when casting Shadow Word: Pain via Vampiric Touch via the Shadow Misery talent.
Fixed an issue where Silent Footpads were not increasing the rogue's melee damage.
Blood of Heroes now also causes your first Bloodlust or Heroism for each plant to not trigger its cooldown. Also, it is now of rare rarity.
Elemental and Restoration: Chain Lightning hits 3 extra targets, and their damage is increased by 20% for each jump. Enhancement: Lava Lash now spreads Flame Shock to 5 nearby targets, and Lava Lash damage is increased by 500%.
Visage of Lethality has been redesigned: When hit by a melee auto attack, scare all nearby enemies for 8 sec. This effect can only occur once every 45 seconds.
New Anima Power: Ancient Remnants (Common) - Heroic Leap rips apart the ground you land on, dealing Physical damage for 10 seconds to enemies within 16 yards. Can be obtained 4 times.
Succulent Carpaccio now reduces the cooldown of Ignore Pain by 3 seconds for Weapons and Fury. It does not change for Protection.
Developer Note: We've received feedback from players who didn't quite remember the expansion switch tutorial, so we've simplified the process and added a second way to do it.
Developer Note: We have changed the flow based on feedback to clarify and fix the issue of whether the wrong region was selected or there are no characters in a region.
Fixed a bug that affected duplicate summons and missions.
To see all the content update notes, click here!.
Below is a list of live fixes for some issues found in World of Warcraft: Legion as of March 7.
Vigilant Inquisitors will no longer cast Searing Review while stunned.
Mining an Azerite Node now grants 20 Honor (up from 40 Honor).
The Blood and Sand achievement now displays correctly when linked in chat.
The geyser period of Azerite nodes is now extended to 30 seconds (was 20 seconds). This will give players more time to reach the furthest nodes from the aircraft.
The «Thrust» effect from the Rocket Parachute now has 4 charges (was 2 charges), allowing players to reach further areas when jumping from the airship.
The respawn time at the graveyard is now 20 seconds (was 15 seconds).
Developers' notes: We'd like to thank you for all your feedback on this new Battleground. The adjustments above should alleviate some of its pacing issues, as well as bring its most-arduous achievement more in line with other battleground achievements.
Family Guy to premiere a Warcraft-based chapter on April 1 Official confirmation
The information comes from a tweet from the series' official account, which shows Peter and Stewie parodying the cover art for the upcoming World of Warcraft: Battle for Azeroth expansion. They also use the classic Leeroy Jenkins scream for the task.
Everything you need to know about MDI time trials
We will collect the best time of each team in each dungeon, and we will add the three to obtain the total score of their time trials. Only the top 8 from each region will advance to the regional draw, so teams will have to do very well to stay in the top positions.
Stay up to date with the latest news in our MDI website!
