20 Useful addons
Priests are spiritually committed and express their unwavering faith by serving the people.
Flash healing- A quick heal but it takes more mana.
Prayer of relief- Heal an ally when they take damage and then jump to another player, up to 5 times.
Joint healing (Talent): Heals the target, the priest, and a third target within 20m. Also, active serendipity.
Holy word: serenity powerful heals a target. Has a 1 minute cooldown that can be reduced thanks to Serendipity.
Healing circle (Talent): Heals all members at 15m in area.
Serendipity: is a passive ability that reduces the cooldown of your holy words (which is 1 min by default) when using certain skills:
Prayer of Healing reduces the cooldown of Holy Word: Sanctify (heals in area) by 6 sec.
Guardian spirit- Increases healing on a target and prevents it from dying.
Symbol of hope (talent) allows all healers in a group to cast spells without expending mana for 12 sec.
Punishment deals moderate damage, reduces the cooldown of Holy Word: convicts and absorbs an amount of damage taken
Jump of faith- You lure a player to your location. Useful to relocate someone in a bad position.
Angelica feather (talent): increases the movement speed of anyone who passes over the feather. Useful to have more mobility or to help other members of the group with mobility.
Use Prayer of relief whenever available. Keep Renovate applied on tanks.
Use Heal to heal a single target when there is not much damage or when you need to regenerate mana, and Flash healing when the damage is greater, as you see that your mana allows it.
Use Divine hymn when your entire party suffers great damage, and always taking into account the use of healing CDs by your companions. Remember that it is a channeled, so you must remain still while it lasts.
Lasting renovation: Your single-target healing spells reset the duration of your Renew on the target.
Angelica feather: Places a feather at the targeted location that increases the movement speed of the first ally to pass over it by 40% for 5 sec. Only 3 pens can be placed at a time.
Perseverance: When you cast Renew Yourself, all damage you take is reduced by 10%.
Censorship: Doom stuns the target for 5 sec and is not interrupted by damage.
The best choice will be Beyond, since it grants us an extra 7,5 seconds of redeeming Spirit, being able to heal for a longer time without spending mana in the case of death.
Light of the Naaru: Serendipity reduces the remaining cooldown on the appropriate Holy Word by an additional 2 seconds.
Symbol of hope: Boosts the morale of all healers in your party or raid within 40 yards, allowing them to cast spells at no mana cost for 12 sec. The best talent in this row will be Light of the Naaru, which will allow us to launch our holy words every less time.
you, another friendly target, and a third friendly target within 20 yards. Triggers Serendipity, reducing the remaining cooldown of both Holy Word: Serenity and Holy Word: Sanctify by 3 sec.
For dungeons, both Surge of Light and Joint Heal are good choices. Mercy will go very well in the band, since the Prayer of Relief will be a healing that we will use a lot.
Divinity: When you heal with a Holy Word spell, your healing is increased by 15% for 6 sec.
Prayer: Your Prayer of Mending has a 40% chance to apply Renew to each target it heals
