Upon completion of the new traits, a new hidden trait will appear: Agreement of the Twilight of the Legion, providing us with an extra amount of intellect. Secondary statistics
Critical hit: Double the chance for our direct healing spells to heal. Critical heals also increase the amount of Echo of Light healing.
Offering of Haste: Permanently enchant a cloak to increase Intellect by 200.
Reserve Divine Hymns for high-damage moments when you can be still, as if you move, the spell will break and you will lose your main DC.
Use your Holy Word: Serenity along with the artifact's ability to get an even greater cure and be able to raise a life that is below 50%.
If you die, take advantage of your Redeeming Spirit to cast your best cures, since while you are in this form you will not spend any mana. BIS team
