Complete guide to Uuna and the Shady Place
Today we bring you the complete guide to get Uuna, make us her friends and save her from the dark place so that she can return to the Light with her parents. Table of Contents
2 Useful macros
Starting at the beginning How do you get it?
When you have everything ready go to coordinates 55 39 and summon the elite. With patch 7.3.5 the drop probability increased a lot so good luck!
We summon Uuna and wait until he speaks to us.
I wish I could see better
Now carefully climb to the top of the terrain without falling into the void and fly to the island that is several meters ahead.
Wait a couple of minutes and then ...
Fly as high as you can and hit the ground. Go to the resurrection angel and talk to him.
BEFORE YOU BEGIN: Switch to talents that give you movement speed like momentum.
Well, you're going to be Aragorn.
The Soul Eaters will go after the little girl. To avoid this, stand in front of the Soul Eaters to scare them away.
VERY ATTENTIVE TO THIS!
ATTENTION ! : If you manage to hug Uuna but he kicks you off the stage and you cannot activate the tear to re-enter, you have already finished this event and can move on to the next one.
Now with the quietest thing and everyone away from the darkness, she asks you to take her for a walk before meeting in the Light with her parents.
You have to follow this order. It doesn't count if we jump.
And after this he says goodbye to you and will return to the Light with his parents…. But no!
