Lost mail now appears in a random location near one of Dalaran's mailboxes, as it should.
In Patch 7.3.5 a new very curious and fun event is added that will allow us to meet the Dalaran Postmaster . It consists of a chain of missions in which we will visit various areas, we will be able to get achievements, pets, titles and we will also participate in a minigame with various levels of difficulty.
The mission is called Lost mail. For now, it is not yet known if it can appear in more mailboxes in Dalaran or not and the respawn time it has once someone has taken it.
When we got there we found ourselves in a strange situation in which a dwarf loses his armor for not having met one of the payment deadlines to the Mrs. Goya. Everything is arranged when we deliver the letter, since it was the corresponding payment term.
In order to go to the office, we must enter through a pipe located in Dalarán, a little before the entrance where we do pet battles.
In this mission we will have to collect nine cards that have been returned and that we will find throughout the room. All we have to do is get closer and click on them.
In order to make the delivery, we will receive the help of the postal assistant Katy Stamp that will open a portal where is the monument of Antónidas, in Dalaran. As we get closer we will see Katy stamp waiting for us to help us.
Once we are in Feralas we will meet Johnny Freak, which will tell us that it is not that he had forgotten the loot, but that he has it repeated, because he had already obtained it the week before and will deliver the mission to us Serve with a smile, in which he will ask us to do him a favor and sell the mount to Gott Flattery.
Johnny Phenomenon will give us a new mission, A deserved reward, and send us to place a Mimiron head in The Mud Fields in Hillsbrad Foothills.
Once this mission is finished, we will have finished the main mission chain and we will obtain the achievement The whole package and the title of Messenger. We will also get the object Lost mail.
The whole package - Achievement for completing the main quest chain.
Object lost mail - For completing the main quest chain. You can send it to a friend.
Title of Postmaster - For classifying thirty letters in less than sixty seconds, without the complete address.
At level one we must catalog fifteen letters in less than sixty seconds. They will give us all the complete address.
At level three, we must catalog thirty cards in less than sixty seconds. They will give us the incomplete address so it will be more difficult to achieve this challenge-
I hope you like it and that with it you get even more desire to play. It seems like a fun event and also with several achievements and gifts, which is always nice to receive, if like me you are achievement hunters, battle pets and other collectibles.
How will the high population numbers in TBC be handled?
There is a desire to reclaim the captureable areas. But they also want to make sure the experience is enjoyable.
Speaking to Terran Gregory, they wanted to include some indication that she is alive in the cutscene so you can see her hand move.
This is something we talk about a lot, especially on the high end of Mythic + and bands.
They were originally a couple of racial issues in previous expansions, but right now the racials are balanced and possibly the Alliance is more powerful, but now the issue is social dynamics and will need a solution.
We asked where the faction boundaries are. We already have the mercenary mode, but they want to make sure that identity and faction are important so that when someone asks BlizzCon to support your faction, that identity continues to exist.
Will your name be reserved in Classic if you play TBC?
If you decide to make a clone, you will have that name in both realms, but you may have a tool that allows troubleshooting with one name.
Are there more plans for connected kingdoms?
Will the Horde and the Alliance never be able to make dungeons or raids together?
It is important to preserve the identity of the Horde and the Alliance, but World of Warcraft is about playing with your friends.
Will the number of Anima be increased later?
There may be allies of his who may be interested in freeing him.
Many automated systems were used. However, they do recognize it as a convenience factor, where you can shop when you have limited time.
What are the actual requirements to fly in Shadowlands?
You cannot fly from zone to zone. These are not zones that are not next to each other.
You can immediately fly to level 50 once you unlock it.
In general, no. We want to keep the authentic essence of Burning there with the final version of Burning Crusade.
There will be new powers in patch 9.1.
There are a number of characters where time seems to have little meaning.
When it comes to raid content, technically everything is 10 player content. But some players want Mythics in small groups.
Will Summoning Stones come in TBC at launch?
There was a price to pay for those visions to see what was going on with Sylvanas and Anduin.
How will PvP titles work in TBC without battle groups?
This meant that only 13 people had the title in America.
The story of what happened to the Night Elves there, who were channeled into the Maw, is not yet finished.
Will there be new Classic servers besides TBC?
We have our eyes on that and we will discuss it after the release of TBC.
