In this meeting we will face the Coven Shivarra, three sisters who will share the same% of health. Two of them will remain active at all times and must be more than 18 meters apart so they do not get a reduced damage buff.
Storm of darkness(Heroic - Mythical)
Torment of Aman'thul->Machinations of Aman'thul
When we start the fight, the tanks will have to catch one of the sisters and move her away from the other respectively since, if they are less than 18 meters, it will be activatedShivaist pact. At this time we will take the opportunity to launch all our damage CDs and BL.
The sister who remains inactive will control one of the Titans, causing it to cast a devastating ability. As a tip, it will be more practical to defeat the Titans one by one than to try to kill all four of them at once.
Golganneth's Torment: It will place an electric field around all the players in the raid thanks toGolganneth's Fury. When one player gets close to another, this ability will deal a large amount of damage to both of them.
The best we can do is stand to the sides of it to avoid fire damage. Norgannon's Torment: Will launchNorgannon's Spectral Armycausing the combat area to fill with copies (similar to the Cordana encounter in the Chamber of the Wardens) to which slowdowns, stuns ... We will have to dodge these copies to avoid receiving damage from them.
This ability will launch it in front of her, so the rest of the raid must always be kept behind her back. Each time it is released, it will accumulate a debuff that will make the nextFiery Strikewe receive, increase your damage by 50%.
On Heroic difficulty, this Sister will receive a new ability,Withering pulsethat will cause several players to appear a fire area around them and that will deal a large amount of damage. When this happens, it is best if those affected are kept separate from the rest.
This sister will have a faculty that cannot be interrupted calledTouch of darkness. This ability will deal a large amount of damage and is work for healers as it cannot be dodged either.
On Heroic difficulty, this Sister will receive a new ability,Storm of darkness, transforming the stage into shadows and invoking square areas of golden color. These areas will reduce damage taken from shadows on the stage.
With a different set of abilities than her other sisters, Diima will have an ability that will freeze tanks thanks toInstant freeze, dealing a large amount of damage and reducing their movement speed by 10% for 20 seconds. This effect stacks.
This encounter will be based solely on avoiding areas and performing the mechanics correctly. That is why we want to give you a couple of tips so that you keep in mind the most important things during the meeting:
Stay away from your peers when you are affected byWithering pulse.
When you can't take any more marks ofFiery Strike, swap the boss with the other tank.
