A celebration that you cannot miss! We hope that you have had a happy holiday season and that your 2017 has been the best of all because a new year is coming… full of surprises!
Despite having been a very long year, the time has come to say goodbye to 2017 to welcome a new stage with open arms. For that reason, if you are playing World of Warcraft during the New Year's Eve celebration event, we recommend that you sheathe your swords for a few minutes and enjoy the atmosphere that these cities will provide.
The party will begin at 18:00 p.m. (Kingdom time) on December 31 with fireworks in the skies of all cities, repeating every hour on the hour. Dare to taste the exotic selection of beers and spirits from around the world and dance until the dawn of a new year.
