Humans of Kul Tiras will be an allied race in Battle for Azeroth.
Character space Blizzard will increase the number of slots with the arrival of the new allied races.
If there is a class that does not contribute much, it is a problem that should be solved.
It is a short-term sacrifice that you are making for the sake of balance. Two years from now, no one will remember that an ability was provided by an artifact weapon in Legion.
Non-Allied Races customization options are in the works, but there is no set time frame. The team is currently working on animations for the new allied races.
Tyrannical and Reinforced affixes will move to Cornerstone level 2 to avoid uncomfortable power spikes.
Changes to profession creation are coming in Battle for Azeroth. Skill point cap during expansions felt awkward and led to the removal of skill point requirements.
No skill point is required to start professions in Battle for Azeroth.
