Rogues often launch their battles in the shadows, beginning with bloody melee blows. In long battles, they use successive attacks, carefully selected to prepare the enemy for the final blow.
He has very useful defense skills.
Ghostly strike: Hit an enemy with your cursed weapon, dealing 252%. physical damage and causes the target to take 10% more damage from your abilities for 15 sec.
Fast hand: Free Pistol Shot uses granted by Saber Slash now generate 1. combo bonus and deal 50% bonus damage.
Fast handis the talent we'll choose when we get the legendary Green leather flooded handles.
Acrobatic strikes: Increases the range of all your melee attacks by 3 yards.
The choice of this talent branch will not affect our damage. For that reason and since all the talents in this branch are based solely on the mobility of the character, we will chooseHookas default since the movement is almost instantaneous.
Anticipation: You can have up to 10 p. combo. Finishers still consume a maximum of 5 points.
Depth StratagemIt is the best option at all times and under any situation since it is the one that gives us the most damage of the three. This talent is recommended and the one used by raiders in this specialization.
Cheat death: Fatal attacks reduce your health to 7% of your maximum health instead of killing you. For the next 3 sec, you take 85% less damage.
Truce: Pacifies a target not in combat and forces them to negotiate instead of fighting for 5 min. It only works on Humanoids, Demons, and Dragonkin.
Truce... well ... I think it goes without saying that your choice is not necessary, right?
Cannon Barrage: Orders the crew of a ghost ship to bombard a target area with cannonballs that deal p. Physical damage for 2 sec and slow enemies by 50% for 1.5 sec.
Neither of the other two talentsCannon BarrageyMultiple murder, falls short of the former in terms of single-objective encounters. However, they are useful talents as residual damage.
Marked to die: Marks the target, instantly generating 5. combo. The cooldown is reset if the target dies within 1 min.
And for this last talent pool, the choice will be easy.
Furthermore,Descent of deathIt is not very useful for raid, and for that reason we will not consider its use.
