Today we bring you a small user guide for the page Character Arena, a very very interesting optimization website for your characters.
First of all we warn you of one thing. This website focuses on people with casual alters or if you are not hardcore, in case you are you would already have to do simulations in Raidbots and the like.
We have two sample options: with our character to compare it or directly to show us what the ideal character would be like.
Within each section it shows us what we have, what is recommended and what the tops wear. In stats we see it clearer but in the rest it goes by a color system: if it does not have a color it is the ideal choice, in red it is not widely used by the characters in the top and in dull gray very few tops use it and it is not recommended .
The truth is that I recommend you keep an eye on it because the project is taking a super interesting form and that will help the entire community a lot when it comes to putting together their pj.
