Doubts about the transfiguration with the prepatch
Since the pre-expansion patch was released yesterday, some players have raised questions and concerns about various issues regarding the transmogrification. We would like to further explain how this system works
Transfiguring an artifact to look like a weapon from your collection should work properly.
However, if you want to apply an artifact skin to an artifact, you must do so at the artifact forge in your class headquarters, and your character can only apply skins that he has earned himself.
Paired artifact skins can be applied to two-handed weapons. A Shadow Priest can now make his staff look like Xal'atath, Dagger of the Black Empire.
