We have just published the full program for the two days of the convention. Take a look at the events that you can see on Friday, February 19, and Saturday, February 20, so participation.
Players level 101 and above will be able to enter six of the dungeons of Warlords of Draenor to earn new rewards throughout the week of this bonus event. The power levels of your characters and items will be lowered to match the challenge, but bosses will drop loot appropriate to your normal level.
Open the group finder (default shortcut: I) and from the "Type" drop-down menu, choose "Dungeon Finder" and "Time Walk." When you press 'Find Party', you will be matched up with other players and then all of you will be sent to one of the following Heroic Dungeons:
Auchindoun is the sacred mausoleum of the draenei, a sanctum of Light in which the spirits of the dead find a rest. Its crystalline structure also serves to protect and shield draenei souls from their eternal enemies: the Burning Legion and their insatiable appetite for draenei spirits.
On the northern outskirts of Frostfire Ridge, the Bloodmaul ogres have a brutal mining operation underway in the sweltering heat of active volcanic caves. Slaves from all over Draenor are transported to the mines never to leave again.
The Shadowmoon clan's traditional graveyard is the final resting place for countless generations of their ancestors. The fallen leader Ner'zhul, at the lowest point of his depravity, has sacrificed the soul of his clan in his desperate quest for power.
High above the Summits of Arak, amid the clouds, the Heavenly Reach stands as the seat of power for the Rukhmar Adepts. The Arakkoa have gathered and mastered the apexis technology of their ancestors, and are now ready to unleash the concentrated power of the sun against their foes.
More equipment will be available from Warlords of Draenor in this event. About bonus events
