Two of these talents in this branch do not differ in the amount of damage they deal.Snake hunterIt is the best option although there is not much difference with respect toFatal wounds, since this difference is only a few thousand points of damage.
Separation: You jump back.
SeparationHe is the best talent for this branch under any situation since it is the one that gives us the most mobility on stage. Neither of the other two talents are bad, but for raiding, Disengagement mobility is the best choice.
Guerrilla tactics: Booby Trap deals 50% more damage and Ruse's effects are further enhanced: Freezing Trap cannot be interrupted with damage for the first 6 seconds. Tar Trap reduces enemy movement speed by (20 - 70)% for the first 4 sec.
CaltropsIt should be the recommended talent for many of the situations where you need to do optimal DPS. The other two talents should be used if there is a mechanic in which the choice of this branch is important or, similarly, that it is not a choice for the DPS.
Fire grenade: Throws a dragonfire grenade at the target that explodes into flames, dealing p. Fire damage over 8 sec and slows their movement speed by 20%. The target's volatile flames also scorch nearby enemies.
Snake biteIt is the talent that we will choose in single objective matches.
Fire grenadenot a good option as a lot of damage is lost.
Spitting cobra: Summons a Spitting Cobra for 30 sec that attacks your target for (100% attack power). Nature damage every 2 sec.
Expert TrapperIt is a talent that we can choose when there are many objectives in the meeting that do not consist of much health.
Enchant Cloak - Binding of Agility: Permanently enchant a cloak to increase Agility by 200.
Excitementwill heal the hunter for 30% of their maximum health
Tar trapwill reduce the movement speed of all enemies within the targeted area. To do this, enemies must step on the trap to activate it.
Cut wingsReduces the movement speed of the selected target by 50%.
