Today we bring you the Blood Death Knight guide with basic tips for the class, recommended gems and enchantments, talents and, of course, the best equipment for this patch. Let's get started!
It adapts to any situation.
Heartbreaker: Strike to the heart generates 2 points. extra runic power per target hit.
Blood drinkerIt is the talent that we will choose by default since it adapts to any situation.
As the default talent, we will chooseFast decompositionthanks to the increase in the generation of runic power, allowing us in turn much more survival.
Blood mark: Places a Mark of Blood on an enemy for 25 sec. Damaging enemy auto attacks will also heal their victim for 3% of that victim's maximum health.
Stone: Consumes up to 5 charges of Bone Shield. For each charge consumed, you gain 6. runic power, absorbing damage equal to 6% of your maximum health over 8 sec.
Blood markit can be a really acceptable option if that extra healing is necessary if we are in the last and the other tank is not available to change the boss.
Tremble before me: Enemies damaged by your Death and Decay have a chance to cower in place for 3 sec, but can only suffer this effect once every 10 sec. Damage can cancel the effect.
In this case we will choose the talentMarch of the damnedsince it gives us much more mobility and is one of the weakest points of this specialization.
Tremble before meIt is not a good option since it does not contribute anything in the raid.
Will of the necropolis: Damage taken with health below 35% reduced by 35%.
Unholy bulwark: Each charge of Bone Shield increases your maximum health by 2%.
Will of the necropolisIt is not a good option since it loses a lot compared to the other two talents.
Blood mirror: Affects an enemy with Mirror of Blood for 10 sec. While active, 20% of any damage dealt to you is redirected to the target.
Blood mirrorIf survival is too much for us and we seek damage, this is the talent we will choose since it grants us much more DPS in single-target encounters.
Enchant Neck - Mark of the Heavy Hide : Permanently enchant a necklace to sometimes increase by 3000. armor for 10 sec.
The basic rotation for this specialization in single-objective encounters is as follows:Boiling blood(to applyBlood plague>Marrow rippers(when we lose all charges ofBone shield)> Consumption(whenever available)> Death and decomposition > Marrow rippers(to maintain the 5 charges ofBone shield)>Lethal blow(to expend excess runic power)
Blood drinker(Talent) is an active that will allow us to heal a large amount of health through a cast.
Ice-bound fortitudeIt is a defensive cd that will reduce the damage received by 30%.
Mental freeze It is the ability of the Death Knights that allows them to silence casts.
Lethal attractionIn addition to attracting the target, it will generate a large percentage of threat.
Embrace of SanguinoIt is used to attract and place all the entities around our objective in the same pixel.
