Thank you all for your feedback on Epic Battlegrounds. We will share our plans to add new battlegrounds to the queue of epic battlegrounds shortly.
This should reduce the power of the Workshop and bolster defense up. Thanks everyone for your continued feedback to Epic Battlegrounds, and we hope to share with you our future plans of new Battlegrounds we intend to add to the Epic Battlegrounds queue soon.
This is your opportunity to make a contribution to the global response to COVID-19 with the Charity Pets Program of World of Warcraft. Your donations will go to the medical-humanitarian organization Doctors Without Borders, and you will contribute to giving two bereavement pets to the community of World of Warcraft.
We have made a change to how the charity pet program works, and during this campaign, you can donate directly the amount you want to Doctors Without Borders. Between now and April 26, 2021 (or upon reaching the pre-established goal), all donations will go to the Coronavirus Crisis Fund of Doctors Without Borders to support the organization's global response to the pandemic and its consequences.
Plus, if we hit the $ 1 million figure, everyone will get another pet: the lazy Margarita. This is a new pet that you can carry on your shoulders!
Little Bananas was born on one of the islands that line the coast of Stranglethorn Vale and is the son of King Mukla, fierce leader of the Celestial Gorillas. Luckily, Bananas doesn't look like his father, and his kindness makes him the ideal travel companion to brighten your days in Azeroth and beyond.
Click on "Pay" to process the donation.
Doctors without borders is an international medical-humanitarian organization that assists victims of natural or human disasters, armed conflicts, epidemics and health deficiencies in more than 70 countries. Their teams offer basic medical assistance to the people who need it most without any discrimination based on race, gender, religion or political ideology.
The objectives of MSF's global response to COVID-19 are:
Provide medical care to patients, especially the most serious cases.
Provide palliative care for critically ill patients in settings with limited resources.
The acquisition of medical material, such as oxygen for patients or personal protective equipment for our staff.
Your generosity to the Coronavirus Crisis Fund will enable us to provide urgent medical care where it is needed and to continue working in more than 70 countries to counter the effects of this new disease.
Kyrian Phalanx health increased by 16%.
Maldraxxus Plague Herald's Plague Song has been redesigned: Now deals damage to ranged enemies every round.
Developer Note: Fixed a number of issues that resulted in the Necromancer's Curia Companions not dealing their intended damage at all times. Additionally, some teammates have received an upgrade appropriate to their role.
Developer Note: Overall, we are pleased with the outcome of the Venthyr changes in Content Update 9.0.2, but we want to help players who use nightblades in their builds a bit more.
The cloaks of the undead will now be as worn as the Forsaken who wear them
Chain the Unworthy (Kyrians) damage increased by 15% and its damage reduction debuff increased to 8% (was 5%).
Elisian Decree (Kyrians) damage reduced to Vengeance Demon Hunters by 10%.
Rejuvenation periodic healing increased by 12%.
Fixed a bug that caused Feign Death to be canceled when Hunters used the map or an emotion.
Spitting Cobra talent damage increased by 260%.
Fixed a bug that could prevent Echoing Arrow (Kyrians) from being launched behind the character.
Radiant Spark (Kyrians) damage increased by 20%.
Xuen the White Tiger is now susceptible to the crowd control effects of Hibernate, Polymorph, and Fear.
Fixed an issue where casting Storm, Earth, and Fire would occasionally unsteal nearby enemies.
Fixed a bug that caused Tiger Palm to grant an extra stack of Mark of the Crane with Storm, Earth, and Fire active.
Fixed an issue where Silfeline Stomp (Night Sylphs) would not deal damage if used to engage creatures already in combat.
Echoing Clarity (Kyrian) bonus spells now have a lower attack rate. Additionally, Judgment's area of effect hits caused by Divine Havoc are no longer reduced by 25% in PvP, but Judgment's effect when triggered by Echoing Clarity is.
Shadowy Apparitions no longer causes targets to break stealth if they don't deal damage.
Jagged Bone Spike (Necromancers) initial damage increased by 300%, and now grants 1. combo bonus and an additional one for each active bone spike after hitting the target.
Jagged Bone Spike (Necromancers) damage is now properly increased with Mastery: Potent Assassin from the Assassination specialization.
Flagellation (Venthyr) no longer costs Energy (was 20 Energy), its duration has been reduced to 12 seconds (was 20 seconds), its haste is applied immediately, and it no longer has a second activation. In addition, its initial damage has been increased by 270%, the bonus damage from spending combo points by 160%, and it deals damage 1 time (was 3) when used.
Lash Scars (venthyr) now inflicts 4 additional lashes (was 2). This will allow the rogues to start with 5% haste when activated.
Lightning Shield damage increased by 415%.
The Storm Guard talent now increases Chain Lightning damage by 300% (was 150% increased by 2 casts of Lightning Bolt).
Curse of Tongues now lasts 1 minute (was 30 seconds) and 20 seconds against enemy players (was 12 seconds).
Volatile Solvent (Plague Inventor Marileth) now triggers when Shape Meat's passive effect consumes the essence of a corpse (instead of when casting Shape Meat).
The permanent RSVP will allow you to invite that person to any Ember Court with all the characters on your account without having to re-complete the RSVP mission with each one of them.
Temel and Lady Ilinca's one-time reputation items will no longer appear once learned.
One of a sentry's bore cages has been moved away from the patrolling chamber.
The logic that determines the level of the first Mythic Keystone that players receive each week has been adjusted.
Following this change, the keystone level will continue to decrease by one level each week until players complete a higher-level keystone again.
Equipment acquired from Mythic Keystone Dungeons can now be upgraded with Valor, a new currency earned by completing Mythic Keystone dungeons and Summons of the Curia. The weekly value cap will start the first week at 5000 p. value and will increase another 750 p. weekly.
Item Level 200: Initial item upgrade level. Item Level 207: Requires the achievement "Cornerstone Expeditionary", obtained by completing all eight dungeons of Shadowlands at mythic level 5 or more within the time limit.
Item Level 220: Requires the achievement "Master of the Keystone", obtained by completing all eight dungeons Shadowlands at mythic level 15 or more within the time limit.
Jeweled sunglasses can now be used for transmogrification and will appear in the player's collection as soon as they are found.
The Dark Strength weapon enchantment will no longer target enemies out of combat or affected by crowd control effects.
The barrier generator toy can no longer be used in PvP instances.
Spirit of the Dark Flame Fiery Mark instant damage increased by 20% (was 15%).
Sleeper's Legacy Rage tooltip now indicates that the druid is immune to crowd control effects while active.
Qa'pla, Order of War in Eredun now resets the cooldown on Kill (instead of reducing the cooldown by 5 seconds) and has an additional passive effect: Barbed Shot deals 10% more damage.
Latent Poison Injectors damage increased by 15%.
Disciplinary Order now increases critical damage by 20% (was 15%).
Blessing of the Sun King now requires Hot Streak to be consumed 8 times (was 12) and grants Combustion for 6 seconds (was 5 seconds).
Cold Front now summons a Frozen Orb after casting Frostbolt or Flurry 30 times (was 60).
Xuen's Battlegear critical strike chance increased by 50% (was 30%) and the cooldown of Fists of Fury reduced by 5 seconds (was 2,5 seconds).
The healing bonus that Maraad's Last Breath provides to Martyr's Light no longer increases self-harm damage. Additionally, Mara's Deathrattle now causes all Martyr's Light self-harm damage to be spread over 5 seconds.
Sanctum of the Burning Protector has been redesigned: When Burning Defender saves you from death, it restores an additional 40% health. When Burning Defender ends without saving you from death, it reduces its remaining cooldown by 40% (was 60%).
Final Verdict damage increased by 15%.
Hidden Blunderbuss now has a chance to trigger your Pistol Shot an additional 3 times (was 2).
Echoes of the Great Cataclysm now causes Earthquake to deal an additional 120% damage (was 175%).
Ghoulish Inquisitor's Dread Call damage increased to 4% per stack (was 3%).
The duration of Will of the Berserk has been increased to 12 seconds (was 8 seconds).
Capture flags located at the ends of Zephyr Canyon now appear after 14 seconds from the beginning of the battlefield, and the central flag appears after 18 seconds from the beginning of the battlefield (unlike before, when it happened right at the beginning of the battlefield). Start).
Bloodlust, Heroism, Time Warp, Primal Rage, and Drums of Fury and Drums of The Maelstrom items can no longer be used during the Battlegrounds Preparation Phase.
The maximum number of players for each faction is now 35 (was 30).
To make the Star Tubers and Singing Flowers easier for both factions to access, both treats will now spawn together in the Dark Forest and the Rooted Den.
Frostbolt now deals 8% of the target's maximum health in Frost damage.
Fireball now deals 8% of the target's maximum health as Fire damage.
Ignition now deals 1% of the target's maximum health as Fire damage.
Living Bomb blast now deals 15% of the target's maximum health as Fire damage.
Demolishers will now deal more even damage when hitting walls and towers.
Fixed an issue where the PvP Talent Purification of the Weak would sometimes fail to dispel various debuffs.
Steed of Glory (PvP Talent) now grants immunity to root and snare effects only (was against all crowd control effects).
The health and number of Anima Devourers required for phase 1 of the Winged Soul Eater hunt have been reduced.
It is now possible to view a brief description of each wing before starting any raid on Torghast.
The number of enemies has been reduced on many floors.
New Anima Power: Ethereal Wild Seed (Unusual) - Soul Form and Seen and Unseen heal you for 20% of your maximum health. Can be obtained 2 times.
New Anima Power: Bone Hoarder (Uncommon) - Deadly Pull reduces your damage taken by 20% for 10 sec and animates a Risen Wanderer or Magus of the Dead for 1 min.
Hidden Emitter redesigned: Now increases Runic Power generation by 100% under the effects of your Anti-Magic Shell or Anti-Magic Zone.
Exterminator has been redesigned: Now provides an additional 2 max charges of Lethal Attraction. Additionally, killing a Maw Rat will reset all charges.
Dark Reaver Lens spell reflection now also applies to Anti-Magic Shell.
Deadly Terrain now also reduces the damage you take from enemies by 10% within your Death and Decay.
Bloodstained Poker now increases the damage of Sacrifice Covenant by 400% (was 300%) and reduces the cooldown of Raise Dead to 20 seconds (was 25 seconds).
Ashes of Sacrificial Souls now correctly increases the damage of the Kyrian Elisian Decree ability.
Fixed a bug that rarely caused Druids to remain in a stunned state if they died inside Pod Keeper (Soul Link to Dreamweavers).
Maw Rat-Eye Bag can no longer be undone with a shorter duration Self-Spell of Wrath of the Beasts.
New Anima Power: Chronomaniac Hourglass (Uncommon) - During Time Alter, you and your exact reflexes gain Time Warp.
New Anima Power: Bewitching Ward (Unusual) - Damage absorbed by your barriers grants you up to 20% increased Intellect, based on the amount absorbed.
Dimensional Blade now resets the cooldown of Blink when used through an enemy and, if cast through a Maw rat, will kill it instantly (instead of instantly killing the Maw rat and grant 3 Blink charges).
Insidious Freeze now works without Always Warm Socks and can be purchased at any time.
The anima power of the Venthyr Malevolence now causes the cooldown of Mirrors of Torment to reset if the target dies under its effects (instead of having to deliver the final blow with one of the mirrors).
New Anima Power: Void Soul Seal (Uncommon) - Killing an enemy with Shadow Word: Death summons a guardian Void Anima for 1 min that casts Void Lash, dealing 100% bonus damage against enemies with more than 50% health.
New Anima Power: Hood of Influence (Unusual) - You can now control your character during Mind Control, but with a 30 second cooldown.
New Anima Power: Fallen Priest's Blessing (Common) - Casting Holy Fire or Mind Blast increases the damage or healing of your next Devouring Plague by 30%, your next Penance by 30%, or your next Punish by 60%. This effect stacks, but its duration is not reset.
Silent Footpads can now be activated in stealth using Vanish.
New Anima Power: Depleted Tesla Coil (Epic) - Gain the effect of Storm Guard every 15 seconds.
New Anima Power: Spiral Maelstrom Bottle (Common) - Elemental: Increases the damage of Earthquake and Earth Shock. Upgrade: Increases the bonus damage dealt and healing done from Maelstrom Weapon.
Ghostly Bone and Spirit Shield have been removed.
Torch of Detonation redesigned: Increases damage per stack of Shadow Bolt, Demon Core, Incinerate, and Drain Soul talent by 75%. It stacks up to 3 times.
Pact of Thickness now increases summoned demons' health and damage by 50% (was just demon health).
Bottled Shadow duration increased to 30 seconds (was 15 seconds).
Pact of Infernal Flames and Crystal of Perpetual Scroll have been removed.
New Anima Power: Heavenly Hold Glory (Uncommon) - Heroic Leap gets 2 extra charges. Can be obtained 1 time.
New Anima Power: Worn Runestone (Unusual) - Raging Rage increases the damage of Overwhelm, Raging Blow, or Revenge by 40%. Can be obtained 3 times.
New Anima Power: Gargolmar's Shattered Hand (Unusual) - Victory Strike reduces the remaining cooldown on Heroic Leap by 10 sec. Can be obtained 3 times.
Splashed Soles, Speck of Rage, and Champion's Decree have been removed.
The action of the expansion select button has been changed to one touch, and a button to change expansion has been added to the menu.
Fixed a bug that caused article content not to be displayed if the phone language and the article language did not match.
The interface is as follows: the upper left button is used in case we want to see the solution in the chat (in the image below we can see the result) and reset to clean the interface. How does it work?
