Survey analysis What do you think of the new design?
1 Azhurethos
Azurethos, the terror of the seas of Kul Tiras, masters the power of the wind to push enemies away from their nest, cause eddies and capsize ships. He has earned his reputation as one of the deadliest beasts in Kul Tiras.
Azurethos Fury: Azurethos gathers the wind on his wings and unleashes a barrage of tornadoes that drift away from him in a spiral pattern. These tornadoes inflict 13.088 p. Physical damage every 2 sec for 10 sec and knock players who come into contact with them airborne.
Flapping wings: Inflicts 69.803 p. of physical damage to players in a frontal cone, repels them and reduces their threat.
Azurethos attacks the group with the power of the wind to try to drive him out of his group. Then I leave you what we must take into account depending on which character we face this world boss.
Push the boss away when he starts throwing Azurethos Fury to make it easier for you to dodge tornadoes.
Azurethos will move to a random player when casting Gale force. Make sure you're not in front of him when he throws him or he could throw you off the mountain.
Evita Flapping wings And if it hits you, it quickly regenerates threat.
Chestguard of Dire Winds: Level 350 Leather Chest.
And I already say goodbye until next week in which we will face a new boss of the world and I will bring you the corresponding article. In the meantime, we continue to see each other around Azeroth.
