Memories of the sinking Did you know… On the islands southeast of the Broken Shore, below the Acherus, you can find a monument and a building of Jinyu architecture?
The Chinese company Lin studiospresented two months ago an impressive figure about one of the most heroic entities present in the world of Azeroth, within the world of Warcraft. However, this was sold the following week and, at the moment, the product is sold out waiting to be renewed.
This company does not have any page and the only method to contact them is through messaging from the Facebook page. You can directly access the contact chat from the following link: Lin Studios Contact us!
This marvel of Chinese architecture Lin Studios is made with high quality materials, mostly sculpted in polystone (resin) for the design of the entire body and the saber, accessories and the armor of the saber as a whole. Although the Facebook page lacks a little more information about the materials, we believe that everything has been made with the same material, even the small stage that has been recreated where the entities are located.
It is clear that we are facing a statue of a fairly good quality, and as it is precisely incredible and nobody or nothing will give us the statue as a nice birthday present, the price of this statue is about710 $ (610 €)so many of us will have to settle for admiring it, but in images.
Would you buy it if you could?
Ladies and gentlemen of the Horde and the Alliance, set up your wardrobes and prepare for battle. The Test of Style has arrived to test your transmogrification skills.
What is there to do: Participants will have two minutes to create transfiguration sets with objects from their collections based on a theme that will be proposed on stage. Two by two, they will go on stage to pose and show off their creations.
Collect all the skins Collect all 12 outfits to go on adventures in style.
NEWEnsemble: Attire Linked to the Quiet Spirit
Don't worry, we'll give you a hand. You can buy your fan card, which can be used to recruit a fan to cheer you on during the competition.
You have to clean up properly before the competition begins.
When the glitter settles and the votes are counted, the winners of the top, second place y Third place they will receive a reward. Do not worry if you are not winners, you will get the Test of Style consolation prize.
Are you ready to go to the last one?
His family and friend who participated with him in Little Sparkz cosplay contests organized a fundraiser on GoFundMe after the stroke to help with medical expenses. The campaign has changed since then, with all campaign funds going to Mike's son to help cover medical and funeral expenses.
Mike and his son Devon live in Escondido together, Devon found Mike in his car suffering the stroke and was able to get help immediately. Many of you probably have met Devon over the years gaming or helping Mike with his cosplay of Grommash Hellscream, a character from World of Warcraft.
