We hope so well because today we bring you the official WoW Guides guide of the Champions of the Light, the first boss of this new raid recently added in patch 8.1.0, the Battle of Dazar'alor. Without further ado, to the nougat!
Horde: Frida Ironbellows, vanguard of the Alliance assault on Dazar'alor, leads her troops with fervor and conviction. Her prowess in battle and her unshakable faith in the Light make her an overwhelming force.
During this combat and as it happened with other bosses of the previous raid, both champions will launch an ability upon reaching 100 energy points.
Without further ado, let's start with the boss's guide.
Frida or Ra'wani are empowered with various stamps and, whenever it reaches 100. of energy, frees them to enhance their allies. Additionally, Frida or Ra'wani and their allies reduce the size of their enemies' battlefield using Consecration and Wave of Light.
Seal of Atonement > Judgment / Sentence: Trial
Keep them moving so I don't reach them Wave of Light.
Seal of Retribution causes the boss's melee attacks to affect all players.
This combat will have two phases and they will be repeated one after the other until we finish with the boss. We will start by having the chief, a crusader, and two of his disciples.
Wave of Light It will be a faculty that we will see throughout the meeting and that will be repeated every few seconds. -Phase 1
At the end of the first phase (which will occur continuously after approximately one minute), the champion will use Delete stamp, which will allow us to switch to the second phase. -Phase 2
Blinding faith ability that will disorient all players looking directly at the crusader channeling the ability.
Heal This ability will heal a huge amount of health, so it is recommended that a DPS cut it.
The champion will launch Judgment randomly, damage that must be healed.
Returning back to phase 1, the boss will cast Call to arms, summoning some extra allies.
Today we bring you the Outlaw Rogue guide with basic tips for the class, recommended gems and enchantments, talents and, of course, the best equipment for this patch. Let's get started!
Ghostly strikehe is the best talent for most situations and the default talent if we don't have the right legendary.
Sword masteris an alternative toGhostly strikebut, for raid, the other is much better.
Hook: Throws a grappling hook that moves you to the target location.
Fleeting attack: Increases your movement speed by 15% at all times.
Acrobatic strikesIt is not a bad option and it is supposed to be the recommended one but… 3 meters more, 3 meters… it is not something that shows the truth.
Depth Stratagem: You can have a maximum of 6 p. combo, and your finishing moves consume a maximum of 6. combo and deal 5% more damage.
combo. Vigor: Increases your maximum Energy by 50. and your energy regeneration 10%.
Elusion: Feint also reduces all damage you take from non-area-of-effect attacks by 30% for 5 sec.
So muchElusionandCheat deathThey are great and good options. However,ElusionIt is much more useful if we know with complete certainty when we are going to receive damage.Cheat deathit is most useful if you are still new to this specialization ... and if you are not especially a dodging ace.
As with the previous talent branch, bothAbuse the weakandPlayfulcan be used for raid.Abuse the weakHowever, it is the one that can be most useful since it will increase the damage inflicted by 10%, in other words, it is the talent that most influences combat.
Marked to dieit will be the talent that we will choose when we begin to use this specialization. When we are minimally equipped, we will change toMake mincesince it is the best option of this branch.
Use Adrenaline RushyCurse of the Wicked Bladesas part of your Burst.
The basic rotation for this specialization is as follows:
Pistol shot > Saber chop > Between the eyes(with 5 or more combo points).
Cloak of ShadowsIt will make us invulnerable to absolutely everything for a short period of time. Usually used to remove all debuffs.
Threatenwill reduce damage taken from area attacks.
Bribe you bribe a humanoid to fight by your side for 5 minutes.
Whack stuns the enemy for a long period of time.
Sprint This ability will allow us to increase our movement speed for a long period of time.
In this first part, I will show you up to ten promotional mounts and their respective images, with brief explanations of everything we know about their appearance.
These mounts were available during the BlizzCon2017 virtual ticket sale. By purchasing the ticket, you not only obtained certain benefits in other Blizzard games but also these two marvels of engineering very unique, according to their aesthetics, for the faction to which they belong.
- Tiger Zulian Presto If you have already liked the mount at first, I am very sorry to tell you that there is no way to obtain it today (that's why it is on this list go).
Upon entering the room, the chief who released the mount Zulian Presto Tiger, he was in the East zone, surrounded by some normal tigers and trolls. By defeatingHigh Priest Thekal, it could drop it to you at only 0.6%, a percentage low enough to force you to visit the room more than twenty times.
At the time it was one of my favorite mounts because it had a peculiarity that the rest of the drakes did not have, it could be used as a terrestrial mount. Currently, all mounts (except aquatic ones) can be used with characters whose levels are below 60, in other words, characters who do not have the knowledge to fly learned.
Following the same line of promotional card mounts, the Woolly White RhinocerosIt is another of the few mounts that could be obtained through this system, specifically with the expansion of the IceCrown deck.
This is another of the rarest mounts in the entire game, reaching approximately 6% of the total number of players who have it in their mount collection. There are still people who sell it at auction for almost 1,5 million gold or from the black market if they are lucky.
The Reins of the Swift Spectral Tiger It will be the last mount that we will talk about in this article obtainable by letters so as not to cover it in the same post.
To complete Challenge Conqueror: Silver (or higher), they sent us by mail aAncient Phoenix Eggthat could be exchanged in Valley of the Eternal Flower, specifically to the East of the map where the Hermit Cho is located, on the Mogu'shan palace. In that place we can still meetFalling Feather Kaithat, when reviewing what it sells to us, we can find up to four frames of different colors:
The truth is that I have not seen it and it is one of my favorite frames. The colors it has already make me fall in love and its rarity ends with me.
Luckily it can still be obtained on the black market or by opening theUnclaimed Black Market Container. However, its drop is unknown and, taking into account all the objects that can touch you in this container, the most sensible thing is not to waste the gold.
This wonderful Quilen Imperialit was given to the people who, at the time, acquired the collector's edition of Mist of Pandaria. It has become one of my favorite frames despite not being very aesthetically attractive but, like the Pegaso, unfurls long ghostly emerald wings that make this mount unique in the game.
In this case and differing from the rest of mounts, Pegaso it can still be earned by playing just three games of HeartStone. This promotion began during Mist of Pandaria, specifically in 2014 and has been part of Blizzard's permanent promotions.
it can… if what matters at the end of the day is that we increase our number of frames in the collection if in the end we will end up using the last one we have achieved… am I right? With these mounts we conclude the first compilation.
Deep down, we love to collect and so we act like fans when we become fond of one. For example, who has not been more than 20 times to the Icecrown Citadel to farm the Reins of the Invincible?
Some mounts are hard to come by but end up being worth it when they drop, even if they have a very low drop or are very tedious as they carry a reputation system. For this reason we want to ask you some questions:
Have you been lucky enough to be farming two mounts and obtain precisely the one you already have?
... and the last but not the least important Do you think that the auction prices of some frames do not cost what they teach us?
For your creation, damtoys has used high-quality polyresin and real fabrics and materials to create the outfit, giving it an astonishing realism. First class Lana Romney (apparently they are sheep with long curly hair, of English origin) to represent as closely as possible the color and quality that can be seen in the film.
The skin texture of the whole body looks very detailed and realistic. As for the beard, it was carried out with a very complex hair implantation process to achieve the most precise and real effect possible.
This statue is a limited edition, officially licensed by Legendary and each one of them has been finished and painted by hand, so no two are alike.
Although this wonder is well worth it.
Doubts about the transfiguration with the prepatch | Blues, Battle for Azeroth, News, Transfiguration | WoW Guides | WoW Guides
Since the pre-expansion patch was released yesterday, some players have raised questions and concerns about various issues regarding the transmogrification. We would like to further explain how this system works:
Paired artifact skins (right hand and left hand) cannot be applied separately when using two items. If you apply the artifact skin to the right-hand item, the skin will also be applied to the left hand, and vice versa.
Thank you. We will continue to listen to your questions and opinions!
