The launch of Tides of Vengeance opens the way to the new Battle for Darkshore warfront, new dwarf and blood elf dynastic armor, faction raids and more. Find out what awaits you in our survival guide and feature previews.
The launch of Tides of Vengeance usher in the new Battle for Darkshore warfront, new dynastic blood elf and dwarf armor, faction raids and more. Find out what awaits you in our survival guide and feature previews.
Under the ashen shadow of Teldrassil, the night elves attack the Forsaken to reclaim their ancestral home in a new cooperative warfront. Between battles, discover what awaits you in a new version of the war-altered Darkshore.
Gather your friends and take part in the new faction raids on Zandalar and Kul Tiras. Defend against invaders and advance into enemy territory for fun and great rewards.
Prepare your beasts and head to the rooms of Gnomeregan to face the challenges of this new pet battle dungeon.
Set sail for two new islands: Forest Shelter and Jorundall, and discover the adventures that await you on island expeditions.
Continue your adventures through Kul Tiras and Zandalar with the new chapters of the war campaign. Enter new quest chains and new missions to advance your faction's cause.
With the launch of Tides of VengeanceWe've added a new way for players who participate in Mythic Keystone dungeons to obtain specific Azerite armor. These players will be able to obtain a new currency, Titanic Residue, which they can use to purchase specific items from the caster Vashreen.
Reaching friendly, honorable, and revered reputation levels with the Champions of Azeroth faction will now unlock the appropriate quests to upgrade the Heart of Azeroth for all characters on the account.
Prepare to relive the epic adventure that laid the foundation for Azeroth's great sagas. With the pre-purchase of Warcraft III: Reforged You'll receive the new Offal Catapult mount, available in-game with Tides of Vengeance!
Battle of Dazar'alor will be available on January 23
