If you want to complete your collection, grab a pack from the Celebration Collection and you will receive five classic loot boxes, each containing four in-game items: credits, phrases, emotes, victory poses, graffiti, plays highlights or aspects. Additionally, the Epic Pack includes three Gold Loot Boxes, so each of these boxes will contain at least one Legendary item.
Add a touch of festive madness to your collection with cards from the new set Madness at the Darkmoon Faire. Get 10 envelopes of letters from Darkmoon Fair (each containing five cards, with at least one rare or better) with the essential pack of the Celebration Collection; Get a random Legendary card from the set with the Heroic Pack; and get five gold envelopes of Darkmoon Faireach containing five gold cards, with the epic pack.
