Custodian Kah-Toll has a mission for you on Oribos. Or, if you forget to accept it there, you can start it from the adventure guide (shift + J).
Where will your adventures take you?
WoW Classic will direct you to the new realms of Classic Era, which will feature the final phase of content from WoW Classic and they will not receive the contents of the expansions. The kingdoms of Burning Crusade Classic contain all new game systems from The Burning Crusade, including the races of the blood elves and the draenei.
Here's how they'll work: Existing kingdoms will receive the new content from Burning Crusade Classic in the corresponding patch. If you choose to play with this new content, your character will remain the same in all aspects, including kingdom, brotherhood and more, only with access to Burning Crusade Classic and all the news it includes.
To simplify the process, we are going to do a quick summary of everything important:
If you decide to play your character in both games, you can use an optional paid service to gain access to the cloned character in both games.
