Blind sweep Alachilla inflicts 15584 p. of physical damage to players in a 12 m frontal cone.
Bled out Affected players receive a 10 % less healing, a 5 % more physical damage and bleed and take 156 p. physical damage each 1.5 s. This effect stacks, but loses one application every 1.5 s.
Alachilla, shrouded in darkness, stalks its prey throughout the Great Entrance.
Decline Alachilla inflicts 10909 p. physical damage to all players within a radius of 5 m.
Position yourself carefully while under the influence of Echolocation .
Players in Alachilla's line of sight will take heavy damage from Deafening screech .
Avoid being detected by the Resonant sonar while Alachilla is under the effects of Veil of blood .
Coordinate with another player to deal with the effects of Bleeding Bite .
