“For wedding rings, I like simple things-almost masculine,” Caruso explained, just like J. Hannah. Fashion and beauty marketing consultant Brittany Hurdle Ewing likes this cigar band because it is “a typical wedding band I saw when I was growing up, but mainly for men; I like the tone of this ring, it is suitable for everyone now.
