For people with round faces, lengthening your facial contour—rather than enlarging it—is often the main goal. To achieve this, it is wise to avoid round earrings and pay more attention to long and draped styles to create the illusion of extra length.
A square face means a beautiful and strong jaw. Jewelry can help smooth and soften your facial structure, and the round, curved styles and flowing shapes-without any edges or corners-prove to be the most influential.
Almost all styles of earrings are suitable for a flattering contour. It’s best to avoid anything with too big a drop to avoid excessive elongation, but everything from rivets to hugs and hoops looks great on an oval face.
