New-type agriculture includes modern agricultural production and business models such as facility agriculture, sightseeing agriculture, soilless cultivation, and precision agriculture. This model uses modern scientific and technological means to carry out agricultural production, planting and management, and promote the realization of large-scale, industrialized, and precise characteristics of agriculture.
The production greenhouse is mainly based on production and planting, and can grow vegetables, flowers, fruits and seedling tissue culture in the greenhouse. Eco restaurant
Three-layer hydroponics uses water as the main carrier for crop growth, and at the same time, it is equipped with nutrient solution to provide the nutrients needed for crop growth. This mode of cultivation facilities has good sealing, thermal insulation, and pure water companion cultivation, which is very suitable for on-site cultivation.
Pipeline soilless culture is a new type of hydroponics facilities, which can adopt three-dimensional, flat-laying and other structural methods, mainly for planting leafy crops. The vegetables produced by this cultivation mode are clean, pollution-free, and can be directly picked and eaten.
A-frame cultivation The structure is distributed in an A shape, which is conducive to the lighting of crops
Aerosol cultivation is a new type of cultivation mode in which water mixed with nutrient solution is sprayed directly onto the roots of crops after high-pressure atomization. The roots of the crops are directly suspended inside the space of the cultivation container, and the roots are in contact with the aerosol.
The “vegetable tree” adopts a multi-stem pruning cultivation method and reasonable control methods to cultivate an ordinary ground seedling into a “tree” covering an area of more than tens of square meters, which greatly increases the yield. Demonstrating the amazing potential of high yield per plant.
It combines aquaculture (Aquaculture) and Hydroponics (Hydroponics), two originally completely different farming techniques, through ingenious ecological design, to achieve scientific synergetic symbiosis. , So as to realize the ecological symbiosis effect of fish farming without changing water without water quality worry, vegetable growing without fertilization and normal growth.
Precision agriculture is a type of agriculture. It is a system of positioning, timing, and quantitative implementation of a set of modern agricultural operation technology and management based on spatial variation supported by information technology.
The plant factory is a high-efficiency agricultural system that achieves annual continuous production of crops through high-precision environmental control in the facility. It uses a computer to automatically control the temperature, humidity, light, CO2 concentration, and nutrient solution for plant growth, so that the plants in the facility can grow Labor-saving production that is not restricted or seldom restricted by natural conditions.
Using this system can save more than 60% of water, about 50% of fertilizer, and more than 20 working hours of labor. It is a water-saving, fertilizer-saving, labor-saving automatic irrigation and fertilization.
