Hastelloy C22 is a omnipotent of nickel, chromium and molybdenum mixed alloy, with better corrosion resistance performance than other alloys, for example, Hastelloy C276 alloy, C4 alloy and 625 alloy.
Hastelloy C22 possess prominent resistance performance to different chemical environments, including strong oxidizing matter, such as iron chloride, copper chloride, chlorine, heat pollution liquid(organic and inorganic), formic acid, acetic acid, acetyl oxide, sea water and salting liquid and so on.
Hastelloy C22 is widely used in the chemical field and petrifaction field, such as the element of chloride organic and catalyze system. This material especially suit for high temperature environments, impure inorganic acid and organic acid (such as formic acid and acetic acid), sea-water corrosion environments.
